{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "怪代币",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 133.32,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "第二类风险，来自代币本身。",
   "spoken": "第二类风险，来自代币本身。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 1.693,
   "speechEnd": 4.151
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "ERC-20 只规定了接口，没有规定行为。",
   "spoken": "ERC-20 只规定了接口，没有规定行为。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 4.62,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 4.62,
   "speechEnd": 8.179
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "常见的非标准行为，有八种。",
   "spoken": "常见的非标准行为，有八种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 8.6,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 8.6,
   "speechEnd": 11.195
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "一，transfer 不返回值，比如以太坊上的 USDT。用 SafeERC20 兼容。",
   "spoken": "一，transfer 不返回值，比如以太坊上的 USDT。用 SafeERC20 兼容。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 11.62,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 11.716,
   "speechEnd": 19.193
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "二，transfer 成功了，却返回 false。这是 TRON 上的 USDT。",
   "spoken": "二，transfer 成功了，却返回 false。这是 TRON 上的 USDT。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 19.6,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 19.6,
   "speechEnd": 24.451
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "三，转账收税。到账的钱，比转出的少。",
   "spoken": "三，转账收税。到账的钱，比转出的少。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 24.86,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 24.86,
   "speechEnd": 28.666
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "四，余额自动变化，比如 stETH。缓存的余额会失效，要用份额记账。",
   "spoken": "四，余额自动变化，比如 stETH。缓存的余额会失效，要用份额记账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 29.08,
   "dur": 7.84,
   "speechStart": 29.08,
   "speechEnd": 36.691
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "五，黑名单和冻结。",
   "spoken": "五，黑名单和冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 37.14,
   "dur": 2.24,
   "speechStart": 37.14,
   "speechEnd": 39.205
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "六，可暂停。",
   "spoken": "六，可暂停。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 39.6,
   "dur": 1.68,
   "speechStart": 39.6,
   "speechEnd": 41.043
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "七，转账钩子，比如 ERC-777，会带来重入。",
   "spoken": "七，转账钩子，比如 ERC-777，会带来虫入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 41.5,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 41.5,
   "speechEnd": 46.373
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "八，可升级。行为以后可能改变。",
   "spoken": "八，可升级。行为以后可能改变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 46.76,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 46.857,
   "speechEnd": 49.893
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "细看第二种。OpenZeppelin 在 2026 年，审计了 Across 协议的 TRON 部署。",
   "spoken": "细看第二种。OpenZeppelin 在 2026 年，审计了 Across 协议的 TRON 部署。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 50.26,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 50.354,
   "speechEnd": 56.779
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "TRON 上的 USDT，转账成功时，也返回 false。",
   "spoken": "TRON 上的 USDT，转账成功时，也返回 false。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 57.2,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 57.2,
   "speechEnd": 61.3
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "于是，用 safeTransfer 推送 USDT 的代码，在 TRON 上一律回滚。",
   "spoken": "于是，用 safeTransfer 推送 USDT 的代码，在 TRON 上一律回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 61.66,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 61.754,
   "speechEnd": 66.932
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "存款走拉取方向的 transferFrom，不受影响。",
   "spoken": "存款走拉取方向的 transferFrom，不受影响。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 67.32,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 67.32,
   "speechEnd": 70.766
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "症状就是：存款正常，提款全部失败。",
   "spoken": "症状就是：存款正常，提款全部失败。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 71.14,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 71.14,
   "speechEnd": 74.45
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "修复是不读返回值，只看接收方的余额涨了多少。",
   "spoken": "修复是不读返回值，只看接收方的余额涨了多少。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 74.88,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 74.97,
   "speechEnd": 79.461
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "涨的正好等于金额，才算到账。",
   "spoken": "涨的正好等于金额，才算到账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 79.9,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 79.996,
   "speechEnd": 82.435
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "这个方案假设不收手续费。而 Tether 保留了开启它的能力。",
   "spoken": "这个方案假设不收手续费。而 Tether 保留了开启它的能力。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 82.84,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 82.84,
   "speechEnd": 87.305
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "再看第三种，收税代币。",
   "spoken": "再看第三种，收税代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 87.7,
   "dur": 2.48,
   "speechStart": 87.7,
   "speechEnd": 89.955
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "协议按参数记账：用户说存 100，账上就记 100。",
   "spoken": "协议按参数记账：用户说存 100，账上就记 100。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-20.wav",
   "start": 90.4,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 90.4,
   "speechEnd": 95.095
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "可代币扣了税，金库实际只收到 98。",
   "spoken": "可代币扣了税，金库实际只收到 98。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-21.wav",
   "start": 95.5,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 95.594,
   "speechEnd": 99.081
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "账面比实收多出 2 枚。这个差额，由其他用户承担。",
   "spoken": "账面比实收多出 2 枚。这个差额，由其他用户承担。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-22.wav",
   "start": 99.48,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 99.578,
   "speechEnd": 104.033
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "所有用户都这样存取，协议就会资不抵债。",
   "spoken": "所有用户都这样存取，协议就会资不抵债。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-23.wav",
   "start": 104.5,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 104.5,
   "speechEnd": 108.188
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-24",
   "text": "修复是按实收记账：转账前后，各读一次余额，只记增量。",
   "spoken": "修复是按实收记账：转账前后，各读一次余额，只记增量。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-24.wav",
   "start": 108.64,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 108.73,
   "speechEnd": 113.876
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-25",
   "text": "这一步要配合重入锁，防止回调干扰前后两次读数。",
   "spoken": "这一步要配合虫入锁，防止回掉干扰前后两次读数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-25.wav",
   "start": 114.3,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 114.401,
   "speechEnd": 118.912
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-26",
   "text": "没有一个库，能防住所有怪代币。",
   "spoken": "没有一个库，能防住所有怪代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-26.wav",
   "start": 119.32,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 119.32,
   "speechEnd": 122.323
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-27",
   "text": "审计时，先问项目方：你们支持哪些代币？",
   "spoken": "审计时，先问项目方：你们支持哪些代币？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-27.wav",
   "start": 122.74,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 122.74,
   "speechEnd": 127.007
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-28",
   "text": "不支持的类型，比如收税和变基，要显式拒绝。",
   "spoken": "不支持的类型，比如收税和变基，要显式拒绝。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep07/audio/lines/seg3-28.wav",
   "start": 127.72,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 127.817,
   "speechEnd": 131.922
  }
